{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b7e3a1c2-9f4d-4e8a-a5b6-1c2d3e4f5a6b",
		"name": "DayFlow HRMS API",
		"description": "# 📋 DayFlow HRMS — Complete API Collection\n\nComplete collection of **all API routes** in the DayFlow Human Resource Management System (Next.js App Router).\n\n---\n\n## 🔀 Collection Structure\n\nThe collection is divided into **two sides**:\n\n| Section | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| 🏥 **Health Check** | Server & database connectivity tests |\n| 🔐 **Authentication** | Signup, email verification, login (NextAuth), session |\n| 🛠️ **Server Side — Admin APIs** | Admin-only endpoints (dashboard, employees, salary) |\n| 👤 **Frontend Side — Employee APIs** | Endpoints consumed by employee dashboard (profile, attendance, leaves, payroll, notifications) |\n| 🎯 **Performance & Training** | Reviews, training catalog & enrollments |\n| 📢 **Recruitment** | Job postings & applications (admin) |\n| 📊 **Analytics & Reports** | Dashboards, trends and report generation |\n| 📤 **Uploads** | File upload (logo / profile) |\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 How to Use\n\n1. Import this file into **Postman** (Import → File → `postman.json`).\n2. Set the `baseUrl` collection variable (default `http://localhost:3000`).\n3. Set `adminEmail` / `adminPassword` and `employeeEmail` / `employeePassword` variables with real accounts.\n4. Run **Auth → Get CSRF Token** then **Auth → Login (Admin)** — Postman saves the `next-auth.session-token` cookie automatically and every following request is authenticated.\n\n> ⚠️ **Note:** Login uses NextAuth's credentials flow. You must call **Get CSRF Token** first (it stores `csrfToken` + cookies), then **Login**. After that, all protected routes work.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "dayflow-hrms"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🏥 Health Check",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Prisma Connection Test",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/test/prisma",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "test", "prisma"]
						},
						"description": "Tests the Prisma → PostgreSQL connection. Returns total users, companies, profiles count and sample data. **Auth: Public**"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "🔐 Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "HR Signup (Company + Admin User)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.verificationUrl) {",
									"    const token = json.verificationUrl.split('token=')[1];",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('verificationToken', token);",
									"    console.log('Verification token saved:', token);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"companyName\": \"Acme Corp\",\n    \"name\": \"Narvin Sharma\",\n    \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n    \"phone\": \"9876543210\",\n    \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\",\n    \"confirmPassword\": \"{{adminPassword}}\",\n    \"companyLogo\": \"/uploads/logos/logo.png\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
						},
						"description": "Creates a new **Company + HR (ADMIN) user** in one transaction.\n\n**Validation (Zod):**\n- `companyName` min 2 chars (must be unique)\n- `name` min 2 chars\n- `email` valid & unique\n- `phone` exactly 10 digits\n- `password` min 8 chars, 1 uppercase, 1 lowercase, 1 number, 1 special char\n- `confirmPassword` must match\n\n**Success `201`:** returns user + company. In development also returns `verificationUrl` (token auto-saved to collection variable).\n**Auth: Public**"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Verify Email",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-email?token={{verificationToken}}",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "verify-email"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{verificationToken}}",
									"description": "Verification token from signup response (valid 24h)"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Verifies a user's email using the token.\n\n- `400` — token missing / invalid / expired\n- `200` — verified (or already verified)\n\n**Auth: Public**"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get CSRF Token",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('csrfToken', json.csrfToken);",
									"console.log('CSRF token saved:', json.csrfToken);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "csrf"]
						},
						"description": "NextAuth CSRF endpoint. Saves `csrfToken` to collection variables and sets the `next-auth.csrf-token` cookie. **Run this before Login.**"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login (Admin)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 302) {",
									"    console.log('✅ Admin logged in — session cookie saved automatically');",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log('❌ Login failed:', pm.response.text());",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{ "key": "csrfToken", "value": "{{csrfToken}}", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "email", "value": "{{adminEmail}}", "type": "text", "description": "Email OR Employee ID (e.g. ACM0001) — both work" },
								{ "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPassword}}", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "json", "value": "true", "type": "text" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/callback/credentials",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "callback", "credentials"]
						},
						"description": "NextAuth **credentials login**. Accepts email **or** employeeId as `email` field.\n\nSets `next-auth.session-token` cookie (JWT, 30 days) — Postman stores it automatically for the domain.\n\n**Errors:** `Invalid login credentials`, `Please verify your email before logging in`."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login (Employee)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{ "key": "csrfToken", "value": "{{csrfToken}}", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "email", "value": "{{employeeEmail}}", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "password", "value": "{{employeePassword}}", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "json", "value": "true", "type": "text" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/callback/credentials",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "callback", "credentials"]
						},
						"description": "Same credentials flow, but for an EMPLOYEE account. Re-run **Get CSRF Token** before this if switching accounts."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Session",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "session"]
						},
						"description": "Returns the current session: `id, name, email, role (ADMIN/EMPLOYEE), employeeId, companyId, companyName, companyLogo`. Returns `{}` when not logged in."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Sign Out",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{ "key": "csrfToken", "value": "{{csrfToken}}", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "json", "value": "true", "type": "text" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signout",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "signout"]
						},
						"description": "Destroys the current session."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "🛠️ Server Side — Admin APIs",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Admin Dashboard Stats",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "dashboard"]
						},
						"description": "Dashboard summary for the admin's company.\n\n**Returns:** `stats` — `totalEmployees, presentToday, onLeave, pendingLeaves, absentToday` + `recentEmployees` (last 5).\n**Auth: ADMIN only**"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get All Employees",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "employees"]
						},
						"description": "Lists all EMPLOYEE users of the admin's company, newest first — includes `profile`, `jobDetails`, `salaryStructure`.\n**Auth: ADMIN only**"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Create Employee",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.employee) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('employeeUserId', json.employee.id);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('newEmployeeId', json.employee.employeeId);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('newEmployeePassword', json.employee.password);",
									"    console.log('✅ Employee saved:', json.employee.employeeId, '| temp password:', json.employee.password);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"firstName\": \"Ravi\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Kumar\",\n    \"email\": \"{{newEmployeeEmail}}\",\n    \"phone\": \"9876543211\",\n    \"dateOfBirth\": \"1998-05-14\",\n    \"gender\": \"MALE\",\n    \"maritalStatus\": \"SINGLE\",\n    \"nationality\": \"Indian\",\n    \"residingAddress\": \"MG Road, Indore, MP\",\n    \"jobPosition\": \"Software Engineer\",\n    \"department\": \"Engineering\",\n    \"manager\": \"Narvin Sharma\",\n    \"workLocation\": \"Indore Office\",\n    \"dateOfJoining\": \"2026-09-01\",\n    \"accountNumber\": \"1234567890\",\n    \"bankName\": \"HDFC Bank\",\n    \"ifscCode\": \"HDFC0001234\",\n    \"panNumber\": \"ABCDE1234F\",\n    \"uanNumber\": \"101234567890\",\n    \"monthlyWage\": 55000\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "employees"]
						},
						"description": "Creates an employee + profile + job details + (optional) salary structure in one transaction.\n\n**Required:** `firstName, lastName, email, jobPosition, department, dateOfJoining`\n\n**Auto-generated:**\n- `employeeId` (e.g. `RAV0001` format based on name+year)\n- random password (returned once in response)\n\n**Success `201`** → employee `id` saved to `{{employeeUserId}}`.\n**Auth: ADMIN only**"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Single Employee",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees/{{employeeUserId}}",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "employees", "{{employeeUserId}}"]
						},
						"description": "Full employee record — company, profile, jobDetails, salaryStructure, documents.\n\n**Access:** ADMIN (any employee) or the employee themselves."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Employee",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Ravi K Kumar\",\n    \"phone\": \"9998887776\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees/{{employeeUserId}}",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "employees", "{{employeeUserId}}"]
						},
						"description": "Directly updates the `User` record with the given body fields.\n**Access:** ADMIN or the employee themselves."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Delete Employee",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees/{{employeeUserId}}",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "employees", "{{employeeUserId}}"]
						},
						"description": "Deletes the employee. All related records cascade-delete.\n**Auth: ADMIN only** ⚠️ Destructive"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Save Salary Structure",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"monthlyWage\": 55000,\n    \"yearlyWage\": 660000,\n    \"workingDaysPerWeek\": 5,\n    \"basicSalary\": 27500,\n    \"basicSalaryPercent\": 50,\n    \"houseRentAllowance\": 11000,\n    \"hraPercent\": 20,\n    \"standardAllowance\": 8250,\n    \"performanceBonus\": 2750,\n    \"performanceBonusPercent\": 5,\n    \"leaveTravelAllowance\": 2750,\n    \"ltaPercent\": 5,\n    \"fuelAllowance\": 2750,\n    \"employeePF\": 1800,\n    \"employeePFPercent\": 12,\n    \"employerPF\": 1800,\n    \"employerPFPercent\": 12,\n    \"professionalTax\": 200\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees/{{employeeUserId}}/salary",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "employees", "{{employeeUserId}}", "salary"]
						},
						"description": "**Upsert** the full salary structure for an employee (creates it if missing).\n\nComponents: basic, HRA, standard allowance, performance bonus, LTA, fuel, PF (employee/employer), professional tax.\n**Auth: ADMIN only**"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "👤 Frontend Side — Employee APIs",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Profile",
					"item": [
						{
							"name": "Get My Profile",
							"request": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [],
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/profile/{{employeeUserId}}",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "profile", "{{employeeUserId}}"]
								},
								"description": "Returns `user`, `profile`, `jobDetails`, `salaryStructure`, `documents`.\n\n**Access:** own profile for employees, any profile for ADMIN. `403` otherwise."
							},
							"response": []
						},
						{
							"name": "Update My Profile",
							"request": {
								"method": "PUT",
								"header": [
									{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
								],
								"body": {
									"mode": "raw",
									"raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"9876543210\",\n    \"dateOfBirth\": \"1998-05-14\",\n    \"gender\": \"MALE\",\n    \"maritalStatus\": \"SINGLE\",\n    \"nationality\": \"Indian\",\n    \"personalEmail\": \"ravi.personal@gmail.com\",\n    \"residingAddress\": \"MG Road, Indore, MP 452001\",\n    \"about\": \"Full-stack developer who loves clean code\",\n    \"jobLoves\": \"Building products, mentoring juniors\",\n    \"interestsHobbies\": \"Cricket, chess, trekking\",\n    \"panNumber\": \"ABCDE1234F\",\n    \"uanNumber\": \"101234567890\",\n    \"bankName\": \"HDFC Bank\",\n    \"accountNumber\": \"1234567890\",\n    \"ifscCode\": \"HDFC0001234\"\n}"
								},
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/profile/{{employeeUserId}}",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "profile", "{{employeeUserId}}"]
								},
								"description": "Updates profile + job details (upsert). All fields optional.\n\n- Employees can update **everything except** `name`, `jobPosition`, `department`, `manager`, `workLocation`\n- ADMIN can also update those (admin-only fields)\n- `phone` must be 10 digits, `personalEmail` must be valid email (Zod)\n\n**Auth: self or ADMIN**"
							},
							"response": []
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Attendance",
					"item": [
						{
							"name": "Check In",
							"request": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [
									{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
								],
								"body": {
									"mode": "raw",
									"raw": "{\n    \"action\": \"checkin\"\n}"
								},
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "attendance"]
								},
								"description": "Marks today's check-in (status becomes `PRESENT`).\n\n`400` — `Already checked in today` if repeated.\n**Auth: any logged-in user**"
							},
							"response": []
						},
						{
							"name": "Check Out",
							"request": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [
									{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
								],
								"body": {
									"mode": "raw",
									"raw": "{\n    \"action\": \"checkout\"\n}"
								},
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "attendance"]
								},
								"description": "Marks today's check-out.\n\n`400` — `Please check in first` / `Already checked out today`.\n**Auth: any logged-in user**"
							},
							"response": []
						},
						{
							"name": "Today's Status (Check-in State)",
							"request": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [],
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance?statusOnly=true",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "attendance"],
									"query": [
										{ "key": "statusOnly", "value": "true", "description": "Returns only today's checkedIn/checkedOut flags" }
									]
								},
								"description": "Lightweight status used by the dashboard check-in widget: `{ checkedIn, checkedOut, attendance }`.\n**Auth: any logged-in user**"
							},
							"response": []
						},
						{
							"name": "Get Attendance Records",
							"request": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [],
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance?userId=&date=2026-09-30&search=ravi",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "attendance"],
									"query": [
										{ "key": "userId", "value": "", "description": "Filter by user (employees can only pass their own id)" },
										{ "key": "date", "value": "2026-09-30", "description": "YYYY-MM-DD — filter a single day" },
										{ "key": "search", "value": "ravi", "description": "ADMIN only — search by employee name or employeeId" }
									]
								},
								"description": "Attendance list with computed `workHours` and `extraHours` (hours beyond 8 = overtime).\n\n- Employees: only their own records\n- ADMIN: all company records (optional `userId`, `date`, `search` filters)\n\n**Auth: any logged-in user**"
							},
							"response": []
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Leaves",
					"item": [
						{
							"name": "Get Leave Requests",
							"request": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [],
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/leaves?userId=",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "leaves"],
									"query": [
										{ "key": "userId", "value": "", "description": "ADMIN only — filter by employee" }
									]
								},
								"description": "Leave requests, newest first, includes employee `name` + `employeeId`.\n\n- Employees: own requests only\n- ADMIN: all company requests (optionally filtered by `userId`)\n\n**Auth: any logged-in user**"
							},
							"response": []
						},
						{
							"name": "Apply For Leave",
							"request": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [
									{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
								],
								"body": {
									"mode": "raw",
									"raw": "{\n    \"type\": \"SICK\",\n    \"startDate\": \"2026-10-05\",\n    \"endDate\": \"2026-10-06\",\n    \"reason\": \"Fever and cold\",\n    \"attachmentUrl\": \"/uploads/documents/medical-note.pdf\"\n}"
								},
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/leaves",
									"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
									"path": ["api", "leaves"]
								},
								"description": "Creates a leave request (`status: PENDING`).\n\n**Required:** `type` (PAID / SICK / UNPAID), `startDate`, `endDate`\n**Optional:** `reason`, `attachmentUrl`\n\n`days` is auto-calculated. All company ADMINs get a `LEAVE_REQUEST` notification.\n**Auth: any logged-in user**"
							},
							"response": []
						},
						{
							"name": "Approve / Reject Leave",
							"request": {
								"method": "PATCH",
								"header": [
									{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
								],
								"body": {
									"mode": "raw",
